{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他此刻在乎的，是让刚刚浮上来的期待继续存在，却不急着把它逼成一个明确答案；开头的强烈出现很快收束，但三小节仍连续向前，因此更像把已经显露的心意稳住，而不是撤回它。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"首段，没有前面新增的具体History可引用。\",\"bridge\":\"因此这里不把当前状态归因于虚构的旧事，只把这一段第一次显出的心理方式记下来：期待一旦出现，他会先维持它的延续性，而不是马上要求确定。\",\"current\":\"f的直接进入让期待并非完全隐匿，随后的dim.却很快削弱其外露程度；与此同时，跨三小节的长连线和连续推进又使它没有中断，于是形成“已经在乎、但暂不逼问结果”的状态。\",\"without\":\"没有前述History可删；这是Thread的起点，当前理解主要建立一条以后可验证或修正的新心理事实。\"},\"used\":[],\"new_history\":[\"当期待刚浮现而结果尚不明确时，他倾向先让这份期待保持连续，不急着要求它立刻得到明确答案。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"首段未伪造过去事件；音乐只用于判断当前心理形态，没有被当作他人回应或关系事实。新增事实说明了他具体在乎的是维持期待本身，而不只是强度变化。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "93ffbe15-76bf-4c82-a060-3a0820165b0a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214516931972Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.328, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:45:41.255829+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ced1b6f98fa11de9e8eabfeffc6d9e31791327da6aaf741d5fb006b8be1ea7d5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, 